  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-28T22:23:24-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 28, 2018, 10:23 pm\">April 28, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>The 17th Annual Toast of Harwich was held Friday, April 27 at the Wequassett Resort &amp; Golf Club. It was a very busy night with music, lots of food and wine tastings, and a silent auction.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/archive/78ce99467a2aff34b47624c8520cada2ec6243be3934d7496629d67a1254f854.jpg\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3751\" height=\"882\" width=\"681\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>Guild members Martha Little Fuentes and Elaine Felos Ostrander silently captured the energy with their brushes.</p>\n<p>Guild President, Chris Banks and husband, Ed were busy selling raffle tickets for the necklace and watch they adorned.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/archive/e227d74aefe4cedbfe63ca58c823fecc8cd357a3e51e9e05c71149dd4daa8c19.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-3746 size-full\" height=\"1382\" width=\"1174\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"/media/archive/8b03b4c9ae08e6192ec4b6c1c2d9c4efaa245381154d34a6d8ac08eb8e6c2562.jpg\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3749\" height=\"1202\" width=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/archive/0d23ad3f6e8272aed59d3ef53a1cd2985634fb35f4eb8559ec9f9c57882f9cd6.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-3748 size-full\" height=\"1280\" width=\"1118\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/archive/1fd47337ffbb4955d924ff06cd6bed7f89c3fe943ee1379261191d0928da3f06.jpg\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3747\" height=\"1366\" width=\"1020\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/archive/59b43ea8321581b0f324b9fe4ddc1f86e86ddc9a01e1cae6a4b86841c7a75479.jpg\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3743\" height=\"764\" width=\"1280\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/archive/49823c5fbeeeb4332bca3de1aa15cf665e413ffa1106ca0181e4cfa9e2ce297f.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-3745 size-full\" height=\"1962\" width=\"3704\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/archive/664b5877bfe100fdbce432682e391e2f49a934460f34e0c32dc0619a0fd201b8.jpg\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3744\" height=\"1280\" width=\"1024\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-ec332f73507856fca5d5/\" rel=\"tag\">ArtWeek</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-74004cd9be5de0d40a61/\" rel=\"tag\">EVENTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-769515a71dc47b3f779d/\" rel=\"tag\">Chris Banks</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-b96a9f5cca619188590c/\" rel=\"tag\">Elaine Felos Ostrander</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-61b02fde4c90b021fdb7/\" rel=\"tag\">Harwich Chamber of Commerce</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-55e09a88f1feffe4fd22/\" rel=\"tag\">Martha Little Fuentes</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-122876bf7d975b7c9560/\" rel=\"tag\">Toast of Harwich</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-57d8e4aa49480c5e18ab/\" rel=\"tag\">Wequassett</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
